            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jenno"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe is good, but I made a few changes. I used homemade whipped cream instead of frozen and I doubled the amount of coffe liquer. I also recommend against freezing this. The top layer gets a funky taste; refrigerate it for 6 hours instead! Make sure it's covered as well."
          },
